\tr{\td{Facts: one immutable record per constant, lazily derived from the store by any worker (\code{\verb~|SIGD~}), manifest-sort condition, single release store, \code{\verb~|F_NONE~}; derivation independent of elaboration}\td{0.2, 1.1, 3.5, 4.5.6, 12 R6}\td{C1.4, C2.3, C3.3, C3.5, C1.13, C2.8}}
